    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d816">

                <pb facs="0895" n="883" xml:id="pg883"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 E.W./8–1544</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4433</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-08-15">August 15,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State encloses herewith a document entitled “Proposed Terms of
                    Surrender for Hungary” (WS–222) dated July 26, 1944. This document has passed
                    through the Working Security Committee and has now been cleared both by the
                    Department and by the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <p>Accordingly, the Ambassador is requested to place the document before the
                    European Advisory Commission as soon as possible. Such minor changes in drafting
                    as may be required to bring it into a suitable form for presentation to the
                    Commission are authorized.</p>


                <xi:include href="d816-a1.xml" xpointer="d816-a1"/>
            </div>
